  "description": "Please Email through the AD\n\nBeautifully refurbished Two Bedroom Apartment with Parking – Pembroke Square, Dublin 4\n\n€2,800 per calendar month\n\nBeautifully refurbished two bedroom, two bathroom apartment ideally located in Pembroke Square, just off Grand Canal Street Upper in Dublin 4.\n\nThe apartment offers bright, well presented accommodation in one of Dublin’s most convenient business and residential districts. It includes two bedrooms, two bathrooms and the valuable benefit of a designated parking space.\n\nPembroke Square is within easy walking distance of Grand Canal Dock, Google’s European headquarters, Meta, LinkedIn and Dublin’s principal technology and financial employers. The city centre, Ballsbridge, Sandymount, the DART, cafés, restaurants and local amenities are also close by.\n\nKey features:\n\nJust refurbished\nTwo bedrooms\nTwo bathrooms\nDesignated parking\nPrime Dublin 4 location\nClose to Grand Canal Dock and Google\nExcellent public transport connections\n€2,800 per calendar month\n\nAn excellent opportunity for those seeking a quality home within walking distance of Dublin’s major business district.",
